        <footnote id="F4">The price range for the aggregate amount sold by the direct holder is $179.18 - $180.17. The Issuer will upon request by the Staff of the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission or a security holder of the Issuer provide the full information regarding the number of shares sold at each separate price.</footnote>
